### Test API Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Get Product Detail - Anonymous
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Get Product Detail - With Auth Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

### Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get Top Closing Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/top/closing

### Get Top Bidding Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/top/bidding

### Get Top Pricing Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/top/pricing

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "password_confirmation": "Test@123",
  "full_name": "Test User"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/refresh

### Toggle Watchlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/watchlists/1
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

### Get Watchlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/watchlists
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

### Place Bid
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/2/bid
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 150000
}

### Get Bid History
GET {{baseUrl}}/bids/4/history
